{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0q1ehbKmIFlTWaGspkzpmQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:36.458795+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0q1ehbKmIFlTWaGspkzpmQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EcnITj4bmiauLCwfjyDYv7bv9SVFKdMvicP44KJzTb0GHDHibiavic9HL9ic4Hv7FUB95icIMYyJpGsbX4E0JmewNdA7g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MxP3NjdZH9OG8Y8gCHwbzeVmQUW7KD8ia0y3J30pzq3OS0jrql0r8FQMbaTwRB3JMNAiaGy2jhe06aLHKy4ISR0Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>   南方科技大学国家卓越工程师学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为加强高校间优秀大学生的沟通和交流，增进优秀学生对学院的了解，南方科技大学国家卓越工程师学院将于2025年7月初（暂定）在深圳举办夏令营活动。欢迎全国的优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/EcnITj4bmiauLCwfjyDYv7bv9SVFKdMviczmk8sJzXdur5UibB2F1hdnup2AwSnozapLCAraAcCSVI0SWM9W3hdpA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>     南方科技大学于2023年9月获批成为国家卓越工程师学院建设高校。学校成立实体二级学院开展教学科研人才培养工作。南科大与产业链龙头企业深度合作，是国家卓越工程师学院建设高校中聚焦于特定急需领域并与产业企业合作建设国家卓越工程师学院的单位。</span></p><p><span>     校企双方资深专家根据产业链知识体系制定专项培养方案，企业专家与学校共同完善卓越工程师培养方案、课程体系、教学内容与教学方法，增加实践环节比重。针对产业急需突破的领域开展校企合作，打破学科专业壁垒，优化学科交叉。企业联合产业伙伴提供半导体产业面临的世界级难题，让研究生在“真环境”中解决“真问题”。</span></p><p><span>     学院面向全球招收半导体领域优秀学生，以国内领先、具备国际竞争力的奖助学金标准吸引一流生源。学院探索创新，按照半导体领域大类开展研究生招生。招生学科专业包括：085400电子信息 、085500机械、085600材料与化工。报考时考生可根据自身情况选择学科专业，入学后学院按学生特长和研究方向培养，毕业时学校根据学生研究成果所属学科专业授予学位。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wiasgOjjsR54z2VJKptn0fnoVT20ibahO7ywVxIUrL2nQkJDkjT2YeQic0BQ1uaAibUUnTyZ8ictjiaCshTjOQUjDMsA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>时间：2025年7月初（暂定）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wiasgOjjsR54z2VJKptn0fnoVT20ibahO7ywVxIUrL2nQkJDkjT2YeQic0BQ1uaAibUUnTyZ8ictjiaCshTjOQUjDMsA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>开营仪式；师生交流；企业参观</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>*活动安排以最终公布为准；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl