ection><p><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“双一流”建设高校或相关专业的“双一流”建设学科，本科前三学年学习成绩专业排名前25%的学生；或其他学校成绩优异（本科成绩专业排名前10%）的学生。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师名单</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span> 招生导师及研究方向详见：<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/0q1ehbKmIFlTWaGspkzpmQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">导师名单及研究方向.pdf</a>           </span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营” 进行在线报名，申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>研究生招生服务系统（https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/，推荐使用chrome、360浏览器），点击“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行在线报名，申请者需在网上报名系统注册登录，并按照要求提供本人各项真实信息。</span><span>报名所需证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（2）学生证复印件或照片；</span></p><p><span>（3）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上所标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></p><p><span>（4）个人陈述（</span><span>介绍学术背景、曾经做过的研究工作、以及将来攻读研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、研究生毕业后的就业目标等，1000字以内）；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语水平证明材料（四、六级英语证书，托福、雅思等成绩证明）；</span></p><p><span>（6）个人简历；</span></p><p><span>（7）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（各类获奖证书、代表性的学术论文首页、专利授权证明等）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>申请截止日期</span>：请于2025年6月20日24：00前，按要求在研究生招生服务系统提交相关申请材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>提醒：入营报到时请携带有效的本人身份证和学生证进行资格审查。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核及入选通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请截止后，夏令营审核工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将于6月29日前以电子邮件形式通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/jlZQ3EGojNfA7npnzl6rMlia5mXsibbRDQYx0qmAvSKEKbVqqv2WcrLCLBP3cgNPr8kJuH1SNx3yTtnsGicog3BWw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>邮箱：欢迎以“夏令营咨询”为题目发邮件给zgxyzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>电话：0755-88015406（宋老师）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7fd1d46734b6f9d9b612bf2c2c830db608ab4c84edfe96dd5064a8d283ff7bc8","textLength":1431,"sourceSha256":"b303dd54cb36bf230155b08863360127a183e256ee913fed34abc7b308b89656","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-26d1299d29ee49386c23","title":"2025年南方科技大学国家卓越工程师学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:36.458795+00:00"}
